  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Sudan 2024 &#x2013; IOM WASH Programme Coordinator</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan is currently experiencing a complex emergency with massive movement of people due to the ongoing conflict. The risk of spreading communicable diseases is very high especially in settlements of the internally displaces persons and in other non-affected sates given the suboptimal living conditions and constrained access to health care, nutrition, WASH (Water, Sanitation and Hygiene) and environmental health interventions. Under the overall supervision of the Chief of Mission and the direct supervision of Head Programs, the Programme Coordinator (Water Supply, Sanitation and Hygiene Promotion &#x2013; WASH) will be responsible for successful implementation and management of the portfolio of WASH programmes and projects of the International Organization for Migration (IOM).</narrative>
  </description>
